OL,5,G0005 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia Spierings helps Justin
OL,7,     Fwho has a genetic condition which
OL,8,     Fmeans his skin is covered in lumps
OL,9,     Fmade up of nerves. Dr Dev Shah is
OL,10,     Fasked to remove a cyst named
OL,11,     FEgbert.
OL,12,G0105 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FCops spot a car speeding by the
OL,15,     FTyne, and when they pull it over,
OL,16,     Fa search uncovers a crack pipe.
OL,17,     FAnd PC Martain Anderson stakes out
OL,18,     Fa suspected drug driver.
